"""What virtual devices of each platform told StratoWeave, recorded for
test_platform_lab to replay.

For each device: the YANG modules its NETCONF server lists, and its replies
to the reads of its platform probe. Recorded 2026-10-29 from these images:

    crpd    ghcr.io/stratoweave/crpd:24.4r1.9
    xrd     ghcr.io/stratoweave/ios-xr/xrd-control-plane:25.3.1
    xrv9k   vrnetlab vr-xrv9k 24.1.1
    srl     ghcr.io/nokia/srlinux:25.3.2
    c8000v  ghcr.io/stratoweave/vrnetlab/vr-c8000v:17.18.02
    sros    vrnetlab vr-sros 23.10.R1, model-driven, an XRS-20 in an
            extended XRS-40 topology
    arcos   ghcr.io/stratoweave/arcos:8.2.1A.P4
    srsim   ghcr.io/stratoweave/srsim:25.10.R7, model-driven

A reply to a get is its data element. A reply to an RPC is the whole
rpc-reply. Module lists are one name per line.
"""


## cRPD's modules.
CRPD_MODULES = r"""ietf-inet-types
ietf-netconf
